{
  "title": "Tala pitha",
  "lead": "Read the preparation, not just the name.",
  "byline": "Ahimanikya Senapati",
  "byline_role": "Founder, Project Odisha",
  "route": "/food/tala-pitha/",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "reading",
      "text": "What should a food name tell us? A recipe becomes easier to understand when we follow the cook’s sequence: what goes into the vessel, how it is handled, and how the finished food is served.",
      "source_ids": [],
      "kind": "editorial_framing"
    },
    {
      "id": "baked",
      "text": "Odisha Food Delite extracts thick palm pulp with water, heats it with rice powder, coconut, ghee and salt into dough, then bakes, cools and slices it. The account calls this tala poda pitha; it leaves fruit ripeness unstated.",
      "source_ids": [
        "food-tala-delite2015"
      ],
      "note": 1,
      "kind": "sourced_summary"
    },
    {
      "id": "fried",
      "text": "Oriyarasoi starts with ripe fruit: squeezing and straining the flesh, then heating and cooling the extract. Rice powder and semolina make a dropping batter, fried in portions. This account describes tala pitha as fritters.",
      "source_ids": [
        "food-tala-oriyarasoi2016"
      ],
      "note": 2,
      "kind": "sourced_summary"
    },
    {
      "id": "follow",
      "text": "Keep each account beside its own ingredients and instructions. Borrowing a step from another recipe may change what the cook intended. The links below let you read the preparations in full; this comparison does not offer a tested recipe.",
      "source_ids": [],
      "kind": "editorial_guidance"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    {
      "number": 1,
      "source_id": "food-tala-delite2015",
      "text": "Odisha Food Delite, “Tala poda pitha,” 28 September 2015.",
      "link_text": "Tala poda pitha",
      "url": "https://odishafooddelite.wordpress.com/2015/09/28/talapalm-poda-pitha-%E0%AC%A4%E0%AC%BE%E0%AC%B3-%E0%AC%AA%E0%AD%8B%E0%AC%A1%E0%AC%BE-%E0%AC%AA%E0%AC%BF%E0%AC%A0%E0%AC%BE/"
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "source_id": "food-tala-oriyarasoi2016",
      "text": "Oriyarasoi, “Talaa Pitha,” 20 September 2016.",
      "link_text": "Talaa Pitha",
      "url": "https://www.oriyarasoi.com/2016/09/talaa-pitha-ice-apple-sugar-palm.html"
    }
  ]
}

